chapter.v:
And by 


the good, 


hand of our God on us, they brought us a man of discretion, of the sons of Mahli the son of Levi, son of Israel, namely Sherebiah with his sons and kinsmen, 18;

also Hashabiah, 


and with, 


him Jeshaiah of the sons of Merari, with his kinsmen and their sons, 20;
